     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "h3",
     "text": "Message from Jivrus Technologies' CoFounder",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "17.3333px",
     "color": "rgb(208, 23, 82)",
     "anchor": "message-from-jivrus-technologies-cofounder"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/971d79a8bbce61a8.png",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "These are trying times as the COVID-19 pandemic breaks out throughout the world. Our thoughts and prayers are with those directly affected by it, and we wish them a speedy and full recovery. My sincere gratitude to the medical professionals who are the frontline of serving. I also request everyone to stay safe, follow guidelines set aside by the government, and take up in your prayers. May the graceful God deliver us from this difficult situation.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/a9b61a5dc0a2f998.png",
     "alt": "Map My Sheet"
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "I also wanted to inform our community of what Jivrus is doing.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/7f49cd2470bcece1.png",
     "alt": "Cloud Flow Director"
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Business Continuity - Our team is working from home to contain the virus spread and to ensure our staff & families stay safe. Support, maintenance, enhancements of our products will continue during this time. As a team, we will keep our operations going smoothly with the grace of God.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/790b1d69262fcd7d.png",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Our products - We would like to provide our products for free if you want to use them to suppress or fight COVID-19 in this challenging time. Please check our use cases and claim a free license",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/26194d490464fb74.png",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Thank you for your continued relationship and trust with us. I wish you to stay safe and healthy.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/57a7aa5d52a85c1d.png",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "May the good God bless you.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
